{"id":"44b33f111b6254b5","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-set12-recursion-graph.md","title":"ZFC Set12 Recursion Graph","display":"df-zfc-set12-recursion-graph — ZFC Set12 Recursion Graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-recursion-graph","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-recursion-graph"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-recursion-graph — ZFC Set12 Recursion Graph","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-recursion-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-recursion-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-recursion-graph — ZFC Set12 Recursion Graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,a,F,C\\in V\">\\(G,a,F,C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RecursionGraph}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RecursionGraph}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RecursionGraph}_S(G,a,F,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,C,C)\n\\land a\\in C\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(G,C)\n\\land G(0)=a\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(G(n+1)=F(G(n))).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RecursionGraph}_S(G,a,F,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,C,C)\n\\land a\\in C\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(G,C)\n\\land G(0)=a\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(G(n+1)=F(G(n))).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The state set and the types of both functions are explicit, ensuring every\nrecursive iterate is defined and remains in the intended carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,a,F,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RecursionGraph}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RecursionGraph}_S(G,a,F,C)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,C,C)\n\\land a\\in C\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(G,C)\n\\land G(0)=a\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(G(n+1)=F(G(n))).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1127,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3437","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-set12-recursion-graph.md|58-df-zfc-set12-recursion-graph]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d490b03448142d4c","36d7463d215be751","5045d216c83e75cb"]}